{
  "name": "TBK Qwen Vision Analysis",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Vision Provider Router (extension point)\n\nSelects the vision provider from the VISION_PROVIDER env var (default: qwen2.5-vl).\nBUILD-304 implements ONLY the qwen2.5-vl adapter. The other outputs\n(gpt-4.1-vision, gemini-vision, claude-vision, clip, florence-2, internvl) and\nthe unknown-provider fallback route to the Future Provider Adapter. Add a real\nadapter branch per provider later WITHOUT changing downstream workflows — every\nadapter returns the same structured shape.\n\nOllama base URL is read from the OLLAMA_BASE_URL env var (never hardcoded).\nn8n Cloud cannot reach localhost — OLLAMA_BASE_URL must be publicly reachable.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 460
      },
